          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "anon",
          "duration_sec": 11,
          "transcript": "[smooth, mocking laugh] \"Caleb’s too proud to tell you, {{player_name}}. His family’s board meets tonight. Walk away, and I return his $10M.\"",
